{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018G4SEwTmhscAznJ7LHheJY","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t【1 ModelRequest v1】CLI：cliworker models select --request-file <f>，或 --level Top --count 2 --usage Heavy --importance high --cwd <p> --request-id r-001；HTTP：POST /cliworker/select。{schema:'cliworker.request/v1', request_id:'r-001', level:'Top', count:2, usage:'Heavy', importance:'normal', require_readonly:true, cwd:'C:/work/repo', timeout_ms:1800000, exclude_handles:['h_1a2b']}。规则：level 必填，取 Top/High/Middle/Quick，大小写不敏感，缺失返回 E_LEVEL_REQUIRED，非法返回 E_LEVEL_UNKNOWN；count 取 1..10，默认 1；usage 取 Heavy/Normal/Light，默认 Normal；importance 取 normal/high，默认 normal，其他值返回 E_REQUEST_INVALID；未知字段给 W_FIELD_IGNORED:{field}；tier 是 level 的别名，给 W_FIELD_DEPRECATED。draft 视图：不带 schema 或带 compat:'draft' 时得到 draft 视图并带 W_DRAFT_DEPRECATED，0.3.0 移除；CLI 允许 draft，HTTP 上 draft 与 view:'full' 都需要有效会话，否则返回 403 E_VIEW_FORBIDDEN；CLI 的 models select 带 view:'full' 返回 E_VIEW_FORBIDDEN，完整视图只在 admin select。【2 ModelSelection v1（AgentLine 视图）】成功：{schema:'cliworker.selection/v1', ok:true, request_id:'r-001', level:'Top', usage:'Heavy', count_requested:2, count_returned:1, truncated:true, shortfall:1, models:[ModelHandle], calls:[Call], rejected:[{ref:'c3', reason:'quota_low'}], warnings:[{code:'W_STALE_DATA', ref:'c2'}], error:null, generated_at:'2026-11-07T10:00:00Z'}。失败：{schema:'cliworker.selection/v1', ok:false, request_id:'r-001', models:[], calls:[], truncated:false, shortfall:2, rejected:[], error:{code:'E_INSUFFICIENT_QUOTA', message:'...', retryable:true, retry_after:'2026-11-07T15:00:00Z'}}。至少一个候选通过了全部非额度过滤，且全部因 quota_low、reserve_protected 或 quota_unknown_policy 被拒时返回 E_INSUFFICIENT_QUOTA，否则返回 E_NO_CANDIDATE；retry_after 取被额度拒选的池中最早的 reset_at，没有则为 null。【3 ModelHandle v1】{schema:'cliworker.handle/v1', handle_id:'h_9f2c', lease_id:'l_7d1e', level:'Top', label:'Top-1', readonly:true, expires_at:'2026-11-07T12:00:00Z', call:{command:'<node 绝对路径>', args:['<pkg>/bin/cliworker.mjs','run','--lease','l_7d1e','--state-dir','<abs state_dir>','--config','<abs config>'], cwd:'C:/work/repo', input:'stdin', output:'cliworker.event/v1', timeout_ms:1800000}}。calls[i] 与 models[i].call 深相等；expires_at_i = selected_at + lease_ttl_s + i*timeout_s（timeout_s 为 timeout_ms/1000）。handle 只在同时满足三点时生成：call 非空、模型为 callable 且未过 TTL、额度检查通过。完整视图另加 detail:{model_key:'claude:claude-sonnet-5-5', cli:'claude', vendor:'anthropic', funding:'plan', pools:[], forecast:{}, direct_call:{command:'claude', args:['-p','--model','claude-sonnet-5-5','--output-format','stream-json','--verbose','--permission-mode','plan'], cwd:'C:/work/repo', input:'stdin', env_names:['ANTHROPIC_API_KEY']}}。draft 视图为 0.1 的扁平形状 key/provider/id/level/prices/quota/forecast/call，不含 cli 键。【4 Event v1（run 的 stdout，JSONL）】{schema:'cliworker.event/v1', seq:1, lease_id:'l_7d1e', type:'start', at:'...'}；type 取 start/text/usage/result/error；result 形如 {type:'result', ok:true, exit_code:0, text:'...', usage:{input_tokens:1200, output_tokens:300}}；error 形如 {type:'error', code:'E_PROVIDER_QUOTA', retryable:false, message:'...'}。【5 注册表（T-004 冻结，contracts/registry.snapshot.json，snapshot_version:1，自包含，运行时不读 .collab）】每个码为 {code, exit, http_status, retryable, trigger_id, trigger}，trigger_id 全表唯一。退出码：0 成功（含 truncated）；1 E_INTERNAL；2 E_REQUEST_INVALID, E_LEVEL_REQUIRED, E_LEVEL_UNKNOWN, E_SCHEMA_UNSUPPORTED, E_UNSAFE_ARG, E_UNKNOWN_COMMAND, E_VIEW_FORBIDDEN；3 E_CONFIG, E_CONFIG_EXAMPLE, E_CONFIG_EXISTS, E_CONFIG_SECRET_INLINE, E_SECRET_BACKEND；4 E_STATE_LOCKED, E_TIMEOUT（可重试）；5 E_NO_CANDIDATE, E_INSUFFICIENT_QUOTA（可重试）；6 E_LEASE_UNKNOWN, E_LEASE_EXPIRED（可重试，需重新申请）, E_LEASE_CONSUMED, E_LEASE_CONFIG_MISMATCH；7 E_PROVIDER_AUTH, E_PROVIDER_QUOTA, E_PROVIDER_FAILED；8 E_ADMIN_REQUIRED, E_LOOPBACK_ONLY, E_READONLY, E_CSRF（HTTP 403）；9 E_HEALTH_DEGRADED, E_SMOKE_DISABLED。403 类触发条件（互斥）：E_VIEW_FORBIDDEN=select_view_without_admin（select 路由请求 full 或 draft 视图而无有效会话；CLI 的 models select 带 view:full）；E_LOOPBACK_ONLY=bootstrap_non_loopback（api/session 或 ui 外壳的 loopback 三项校验任一失败）；E_ADMIN_REQUIRED=admin_route_no_session（管理读写路由无有效会话，含过期）；E_READONLY=write_route_readonly（会话有效、插件 readonly、写路由）；E_CSRF=write_route_csrf_invalid（会话有效、可写、csrf 缺失或不匹配）。写路由判定顺序：会话 > readonly > csrf > 请求体校验。警告码：W_FIELD_IGNORED, W_FIELD_DEPRECATED, W_CONFIG_V1, W_STALE_DATA, W_DRAFT_DEPRECATED, W_MODELS_MANUAL_REQUIRED, W_LEGACY_USAGE, W_TEST_CLOCK。v1 拒选原因：excluded, level_mismatch, level_unassigned, availability_unverified, availability_blocked, availability_unavailable, availability_stale, deprecated, identity_unverified, identity_mismatch, readonly_unavailable, adapter_unverified, quota_low, quota_unknown_policy, reserve_protected；not_allowed 只出现在管理视图。draft 拒选原因：excluded, not_in_workspace_order, level:<Level>, availability:<state>, identity_unverified, readonly_unavailable, E_FORECAST_EXHAUSTION，与 v1 的映射在 contracts/spec/migration-map.json。forecast reason：no_samples, capacity_unknown, ledger_capacity_unknown, credits_conversion_missing, usd_samples_missing, reading_stale, window_unknown。risk 取 ok/low_reserve/critical/exhausted/unknown；risk_basis 取 tasks/usd/fraction/none；tasks_left_basis 取 tasks/usd/none。阈值表：tasks 依据 <=0 exhausted、1..2 critical、3..5 low_reserve、>=6 ok；fraction 依据 <=0 exhausted、<0.05 critical、<0.15 low_reserve、其余 ok；优先级 tasks > usd > fraction > unknown。可用性取 unverified/callable/blocked/unavailable/deprecated；identity 取 verified/unverified/mismatch。semantic_change：forecast.tasks_left、forecast.risk、handle.cli_removed、draft_reason_mapping、config_v1_to_v2。【6 额度池】{id:'claude:plan-5h', cli:'claude', kind:'plan_window', funding:'plan', window:{length_s:18000, anchor:'rolling', start_at:'...', reset_at:'...', reset_source:'cli|config|estimated|unknown'}, capacity_mtok:{'claude:claude-opus-5-5':{value:2, source:'config'}, 'claude:claude-sonnet-5-5':{value:10, source:'measured', confidence:'medium'}}, used_fraction:{value:0.5, source:'cli', at:'...'}, credits_per_mtok:null}。kind 取 plan_window/plan_weekly/credits/prepaid_usd；funding 取 plan/paid。v1 配置的 quotas 映射：remaining_pct 映射为计划内池，used=1-pct/100；remaining+credits 映射为 credits 池；remaining_usd 映射为 prepaid_usd 池；unit tokens 映射为容量已知的池。【7 forecast v1（只加字段）】{schema:'cliworker.forecast/v1', status:'known|unknown', model:'claude:claude-sonnet-5-5', remaining_mtok:5, remaining_fraction:0.5, pools:[{pool_id:'claude:plan-5h', remaining_mtok:5, remaining_fraction:0.5, reset_at:'...', reset_in_h:3, reset_source:'cli'}], tokens_per_task:{p25:0.05, p50:0.2, p90:0.9, n:12}, tasks_left:5, tasks_left_basis:'tasks', tasks_left_assumed:null, burn_mtok_per_hour:1.1, eta_exhaust_at:'...', exhausts_before_reset:false, risk:'ok', risk_basis:'tasks', confidence:'medium', reason:null, burn_per_task:0.42, samples:12}。公式：remaining(m)=min_p cap_p(m)*(1-clamp(used_p))；有新鲜读数（age<=reading_ttl_s，默认 600）时 used_p=reading+sum(读数之后的行) tokens_i/(cap_p(model_i)*1e6)，否则为窗口内同样求和；窗口内任一行模型容量未知时为 unknown(ledger_capacity_unknown)。计费 tokens=input+output+cache_write+cache_read_weight*cache_read，权重默认 0。分位数 nearest-rank：sorted[ceil(p*n)-1]，n>=3；Heavy/Normal/Light 取 p90/p50/p25。tasks_left=floor(remaining/分位数)。样本不足时 tasks_left 为 null，tasks_left_assumed=floor(remaining/policy.usage_estimate_mtok[usage])，confidence 为 none，risk 只能来自 fraction 或为 unknown。confidence：n=0 none，1..4 low，5..19 medium，>=20 high（变异系数>1 降为 medium）。burn=窗口内已用 Mtok/max(距窗口起点小时数,1/60)；eta=now+remaining/burn；输出保留 3 位小数，四舍五入远离零。容量学习：只用 Δfraction>=0.01 的读数对，cap=sum(tokens)/sum(Δfraction)/1e6，k<3 low，3..9 medium，>=10 high。所有 now 均取自 ctx.clock.now()。【8 选模策略】est 取分位数，样本不足时取 assumed；avail_p=remaining_p-有效预留-(importance 为 normal 时 reserve_fraction_for_high*cap_p)。A 类：计划内池全部已知且 min avail>=est，按紧迫度 min_p remaining_p/max(reset_in_h_p,0.25) 降序，再按价格升序、key 升序。B 类：计划内剩余未知且 unknown_policy 为 after_known，按 key 升序。C 类：付费池已知且 >=est，标 funding paid，按价格升序、key 升序。count>1 时先按 identity_group 去重贪心选，再按顺序补齐。【9 用量行 cliworker.usage/v1（只加字段）】{schema:'cliworker.usage/v1', id:'u_1', idempotency_key:'l_7d1e:post', lease_id:'l_7d1e', model:'claude:claude-sonnet-5-5', pools:['claude:plan-5h'], kind:'task|probe|manual', input_tokens:1200, output_tokens:300, cache_read_tokens:0, cache_write_tokens:0, cost_usd:0.0081, pool_fraction_before:0.48, pool_fraction_after:0.5, at:'...'}。同一 idempotency_key 写入返回已有 id，读取只计一次。【10 model/v1 与 inventory/v1】model：{schema:'cliworker.model/v1', key, id, cli, provider, vendor, aliases, allowed, level, level_source:{kind:'config|measured|cli', ref, at}, availability:{state, reason, at, ttl_s, evidence:{probe_id, cmd_redacted, exit, duration_ms, nonce_ok, reported_model, tokens}}, identity, capabilities:{context_tokens, readonly, stdin}, prices:{input_per_mtok, output_per_mtok, source}, source:{kind:'subcommand|help|cache|api|manual', ref, at}, deprecated}。inventory：{schema:'cliworker.inventory/v1', generated_at, host:{platform, arch, wsl_distros:[]}, entries:[{id, recognized, platform:'win32|darwin|linux|wsl:<d>', path, realpath, version, fingerprint:{size, mtime, realpath}, auth:{state:'logged_in|logged_out|token_ref|unknown', source:'cli_status'}, evidence:[{kind, cmd_redacted, exit, at, digest}], first_seen, last_seen, status:'present|gone'}]}。【11 配置 cliworker.config/v2 与路径】{schema:'cliworker.config/v2', state_dir:'./state', secrets:{kimi:{ref:'env:KIMI_API_KEY'}}, discovery:{extra_dirs:[], wsl:true, probe_unknown:false, unknown_patterns:['*-cli','*agent*'], cli_overrides:{}}, catalog:{allow:[], levels:{}, aliases:{}, deprecated:{}, manual:[]}, pools:[], policy:{probe_ttl_s:21600, lease_ttl_s:7200, reading_ttl_s:600, lock_stale_ms:30000, lock_wait_ms:5000, lock_poll_ms:50, session_ttl_s:43200, reserve_fraction_for_high:0.15, unknown_policy:'after_known|reject', usage_estimate_mtok:{Heavy:2, Normal:0.5, Light:0.1}, cache_read_weight:0, probe_schedule:null}}。resolvePaths({configPath, env})：configPath 依次取参数、CLIWORKER_CONFIG、CLIWORKER_HOME/config.json；state_dir 依次取显式值（相对路径按配置文件目录解析）、CLIWORKER_HOME/state/<sha256(规范化绝对路径，win32 转小写) 前 12 位>。CLI 与插件共用。无 schema 或 v1 配置在内存迁移并给 W_CONFIG_V1。带 _example:true，或忽略 _example 后与随包 example 深相等的配置返回 E_CONFIG_EXAMPLE。【12 HTTP 路由】AgentLine 级：POST /cliworker/select，只输出 AgentLine 视图；view:'full' 或 draft 无有效会话返回 403 E_VIEW_FORBIDDEN。自举例外：GET /cliworker/api/session 与 GET /cliworker/ui（静态外壳，无数据）不要求会话，只做 loopback 三项校验（socket 远端为 127.0.0.1/::1/::ffff:127.0.0.1；Host 主机名为 localhost/127.0.0.1/[::1]；Origin 缺省或为 loopback），失败返回 403 E_LOOPBACK_ONLY；session 响应 {schema:'cliworker.session/v1', session:'<32 字节随机 base64url>', csrf:'<base64url(HMAC-SHA256(进程密钥, session))>', expires_at:'...'}，只存内存，TTL 为 policy.session_ttl_s，进程重启失效，仅用请求头 x-cliworker-session 与 x-cliworker-csrf，不用 cookie。管理读：GET /cliworker/providers、/models、/forecast?model=<key>、/api/snapshot?since=<rev>、/api/jobs/<id>，无有效会话返回 403 E_ADMIN_REQUIRED。管理写：POST /cliworker/api/discover|enumerate|probe|read-usage（返回 job_id）、allow|deny|level|alias|manual-model|pool、secret（只写，响应仅 state:'set'）；判定顺序：无有效会话 E_ADMIN_REQUIRED，readonly E_READONLY，csrf 缺失或不匹配 E_CSRF，请求体非法 E_REQUEST_INVALID。公共：GET /cliworker/health 返回 {status:'ok|degraded', checks:[{id, ok, detail}], registration:'ok|failed', test_clock:false}，不含 provider 细节。所有 HTTP 响应与 CLI 输出共用 lib/contract/scan.mjs 检查。【13 CLI】init | paths | doctor | discover [--full] [--probe-unknown] | models enumerate|list|add|allow|deny|level|alias|probe|forecast|select | admin select | pools list|set | usage record|summary|import | cli resolve --model <key> --cwd <p> [--platform win32|darwin|linux|wsl:<d>] [--readonly] | run --lease <id> --state-dir <d> --config <c> | auth set <cli> [--from-env NAME]（不加时从 stdin 读）|status|clear | config migrate --in <v1> --out <v2> | state backup|restore|migrate | --version。除 run 输出 JSONL 外，stdout 都是单个 JSON，错误体 {ok:false, error:{code, message, retryable, retry_after}}，退出码按注册表；设置了 CLIWORKER_TEST_CLOCK_FILE 时每个输出 warnings 含 W_TEST_CLOCK。【14 宿主契约 contracts/host/dsh-host.v1.json】ctx.inject(['webServer'], fn(httpCtx))；httpCtx.effect(fn, name)；httpCtx.webServer.register({kind:'exact', path, handler(req,res)})；req 需提供 socket.remoteAddress 与 headers。createPlugin(hostCtx, settings, deps) 返回 {registered:[path], errors:[{path, message}]}；getRegistration() 返回 {status:'ok|failed', registered, errors}；strict:true 时注册失败直接抛出。【15 测试设施格式】AC 索引 contracts/spec/ac-index.json：{schema:'cliworker.ac-index/v1', acs:[{ac:'AC-038', owner:'T-029', milestone:'M5', levels:['smoke'], baseline:['real-smoke']}]}，baseline 只在此声明，取 linux/win32/darwin/real-smoke，unit/contract/integration/e2e 只能取前三者，smoke 只能取 linux 或 real-smoke。追踪分片 test/traceability/<T>.json：{task:'T-006', milestone:'M1', entries:[{ac:'AC-015', files:['test/unit/pools.test.mjs'], status:'covered'}]}，只能列属主为该任务的 AC；重复或非属主即失败；无分片的 AC 视为 planned。缺陷账本 test/characterization/defects.json：{defects:[{id:'a5-shell', owner_task:'T-010', owner_milestone:'M2', ac:'AC-026'}]}；缺陷文件含 [repro]（对 v0.1 副本）与 [fixed]（对 live lib）两部分。冻结清单 test/characterization/frozen-files.json：{source_commit:'f75bb76', files:[{path:'test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/lib/select.mjs', sha256:'...'}]}，path 只能位于该副本目录或为 test/characterization/stable.test.mjs。运行清单 files-executed.json：{mode:'full|filtered', filter:null, files:[...], platform, node}，只有 full 做集合相等。跳过记录：{schema:'cliworker.skip/v1', test, file, ac:'AC-027', requires:'win32|wsl|darwin|linux|pwsh|secret-tool|security', platform, node, reason, at}。smoke 报告：{schema:'cliworker.smoke/v1', mode:'real|dry-run', version, platform, node, steps:[{id:'wsl-discover', ac:['AC-038'], mandatory:true, status:'pass|fail|skip', reason, duration_ms}], redacted:true}；dry-run 步骤为 discover, wsl-discover（夹具）, enumerate, probe, select, run, http-select；real 模式在 win32 主机上 wsl-discover 为 mandatory。豁免 release/waivers.json：{waivers:[{ac:'AC-038', reason:'...', approved_by:'...', version:'0.2.0'}]}，只适用于 baseline 为 real-smoke 的 AC，单列为 waived，不算 pass。全流程步骤 test/flows/steps/<id>.mjs 导出 {id, introduced_by, run(env)}，必需集合为 auth, doctor, discover, enumerate, probe, select, run, http-select, http-admin。【16 上下文与时钟 contracts/context/context.v1.json】createContext(overrides) 返回 {exec, fs, fetch, env, platform, stdout, stderr, random, clock, now}；clock：{now():number, nowIso():string, setTimeout(fn, ms):handle, clearTimeout(handle), sleep(ms):Promise}；now 等于 clock.now。真实实现在 lib/context.mjs，设置了 CLIWORKER_TEST_CLOCK_FILE 时 now() 每次读该文件（毫秒数或 ISO）。测试伪时钟 test/helpers/clock.mjs 另提供 setNow(t)、advance(ms):Promise（按到期时间、相同时按注册顺序触发，回调间让出微任务）、pending():number；伪时钟下 sleep 只随 advance 前进。test/helpers/ctx.mjs 提供 fakeExec（记录 argv、env 名、调用次数）、fakeFs（访问探针）、fakeClock、fakeFetch。【17 仓库内权威规格与金标对应】contracts/registry.snapshot.json 对应 AC-009、AC-010、AC-059 的码与触发、AC-067 的 semantic_change；contracts/spec/surfaces.json 对应 AC-005；contracts/spec/migration-map.json 对应 AC-034、AC-067；contracts/golden/quota-shapes.json 对应 AC-015；contracts/golden/b44.json 对应 AC-016；contracts/golden/forecast/*.json 对应 AC-017；contracts/golden/capacity.json 对应 AC-050；contracts/golden/policy/*.json 对应 AC-051；docs/contract.md 由 scripts/gen-contract-doc.mjs 生成。npm 包包含 contracts/registry.snapshot.json、contracts/schemas、contracts/host、contracts/context、contracts/agentline-forbidden.json，不含 contracts/golden、contracts/spec 与 .collab。\n2\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"03eb083b-39d8-47c6-b7b2-ee84e7da3ea6","uuid":"85350b2c-fd59-4bf2-936b-e450b56ff950","timestamp":"2026-11-07T13:47:28.477Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\git\\dsh-CLIWorker\\.collab\\worktrees\\001\\.collab\\blueprint\\cliworker-v2\\interfaces.md","content":"【1 ModelRequest v1】CLI：cliworker models select --request-file <f>，或 --level Top --count 2 --usage Heavy --importance high --cwd <p> --request-id r-001；HTTP：POST /cliworker/select。{schema:'cliworker.request/v1', request_id:'r-001', level:'Top', count:2, usage:'Heavy', importance:'normal', require_readonly:true, cwd:'C:/work/repo', timeout_ms:1800000, exclude_handles:['h_1a2b']}。规则：level 必填，取 Top/High/Middle/Quick，大小写不敏感，缺失返回 E_LEVEL_REQUIRED，非法返回 E_LEVEL_UNKNOWN；count 取 1..10，默认 1；usage 取 Heavy/Normal/Light，默认 Normal；importance 取 normal/high，默认 normal，其他值返回 E_REQUEST_INVALID；未知字段给 W_FIELD_IGNORED:{field}；tier 是 level 的别名，给 W_FIELD_DEPRECATED。draft 视图：不带 schema 或带 compat:'draft' 时得到 draft 视图并带 W_DRAFT_DEPRECATED，0.3.0 移除；CLI 允许 draft，HTTP 上 draft 与 view:'full' 都需要有效会话，否则返回 403 E_VIEW_FORBIDDEN；CLI 的 models select 带 view:'full' 返回 E_VIEW_FORBIDDEN，完整视图只在 admin select。【2 ModelSelection v1（AgentLine 视图）】成功：{schema:'cliworker.selection/v1', ok:true, request_id:'r-001', level:'Top', usage:'Heavy', count_requested:2, count_returned:1, truncated:true, shortfall:1, models:[ModelHandle], calls:[Call], rejected:[{ref:'c3', reason:'quota_low'}], warnings:[{code:'W_STALE_DATA', ref:'c2'}], error:null, generated_at:'2026-11-07T10:00:00Z'}。失败：{schema:'cliworker.selection/v1', ok:false, request_id:'r-001', models:[], calls:[], truncated:false, shortfall:2, rejected:[], error:{code:'E_INSUFFICIENT_QUOTA', message:'...', retryable:true, retry_after:'2026-11-07T15:00:00Z'}}。至少一个候选通过了全部非额度过滤，且全部因 quota_low、reserve_protected 或 quota_unknown_policy 被拒时返回 E_INSUFFICIENT_QUOTA，否则返回 E_NO_CANDIDATE；retry_after 取被额度拒选的池中最早的 reset_at，没有则为 null。【3 ModelHandle v1】{schema:'cliworker.handle/v1', handle_id:'h_9f2c', lease_id:'l_7d1e', level:'Top', label:'Top-1', readonly:true, expires_at:'2026-11-07T12:00:00Z', call:{command:'<node 绝对路径>', args:['<pkg>/bin/cliworker.mjs','run','--lease','l_7d1e','--state-dir','<abs state_dir>','--config','<abs config>'], cwd:'C:/work/repo', input:'stdin', output:'cliworker.event/v1', timeout_ms:1800000}}。calls[i] 与 models[i].call 深相等；expires_at_i = selected_at + lease_ttl_s + i*timeout_s（timeout_s 为 timeout_ms/1000）。handle 只在同时满足三点时生成：call 非空、模型为 callable 且未过 TTL、额度检查通过。完整视图另加 detail:{model_key:'claude:claude-sonnet-5-5', cli:'claude', vendor:'anthropic', funding:'plan', pools:[], forecast:{}, direct_call:{command:'claude', args:['-p','--model','claude-sonnet-5-5','--output-format','stream-json','--verbose','--permission-mode','plan'], cwd:'C:/work/repo', input:'stdin', env_names:['ANTHROPIC_API_KEY']}}。draft 视图为 0.1 的扁平形状 key/provider/id/level/prices/quota/forecast/call，不含 cli 键。【4 Event v1（run 的 stdout，JSONL）】{schema:'cliworker.event/v1', seq:1, lease_id:'l_7d1e', type:'start', at:'...'}；type 取 start/text/usage/result/error；result 形如 {type:'result', ok:true, exit_code:0, text:'...', usage:{input_tokens:1200, output_tokens:300}}；error 形如 {type:'error', code:'E_PROVIDER_QUOTA', retryable:false, message:'...'}。【5 注册表（T-004 冻结，contracts/registry.snapshot.json，snapshot_version:1，自包含，运行时不读 .collab）】每个码为 {code, exit, http_status, retryable, trigger_id, trigger}，trigger_id 全表唯一。退出码：0 成功（含 truncated）；1 E_INTERNAL；2 E_REQUEST_INVALID, E_LEVEL_REQUIRED, E_LEVEL_UNKNOWN, E_SCHEMA_UNSUPPORTED, E_UNSAFE_ARG, E_UNKNOWN_COMMAND, E_VIEW_FORBIDDEN；3 E_CONFIG, E_CONFIG_EXAMPLE, E_CONFIG_EXISTS, E_CONFIG_SECRET_INLINE, E_SECRET_BACKEND；4 E_STATE_LOCKED, E_TIMEOUT（可重试）；5 E_NO_CANDIDATE, E_INSUFFICIENT_QUOTA（可重试）；6 E_LEASE_UNKNOWN, E_LEASE_EXPIRED（可重试，需重新申请）, E_LEASE_CONSUMED, E_LEASE_CONFIG_MISMATCH；7 E_PROVIDER_AUTH, E_PROVIDER_QUOTA, E_PROVIDER_FAILED；8 E_ADMIN_REQUIRED, E_LOOPBACK_ONLY, E_READONLY, E_CSRF（HTTP 403）；9 E_HEALTH_DEGRADED, E_SMOKE_DISABLED。403 类触发条件（互斥）：E_VIEW_FORBIDDEN=select_view_without_admin（select 路由请求 full 或 draft 视图而无有效会话；CLI 的 models select 带 view:full）；E_LOOPBACK_ONLY=bootstrap_non_loopback（api/session 或 ui 外壳的 loopback 三项校验任一失败）；E_ADMIN_REQUIRED=admin_route_no_session（管理读写路由无有效会话，含过期）；E_READONLY=write_route_readonly（会话有效、插件 readonly、写路由）；E_CSRF=write_route_csrf_invalid（会话有效、可写、csrf 缺失或不匹配）。写路由判定顺序：会话 > readonly > csrf > 请求体校验。警告码：W_FIELD_IGNORED, W_FIELD_DEPRECATED, W_CONFIG_V1, W_STALE_DATA, W_DRAFT_DEPRECATED, W_MODELS_MANUAL_REQUIRED, W_LEGACY_USAGE, W_TEST_CLOCK。v1 拒选原因：excluded, level_mismatch, level_unassigned, availability_unverified, availability_blocked, availability_unavailable, availability_stale, deprecated, identity_unverified, identity_mismatch, readonly_unavailable, adapter_unverified, quota_low, quota_unknown_policy, reserve_protected；not_allowed 只出现在管理视图。draft 拒选原因：excluded, not_in_workspace_order, level:<Level>, availability:<state>, identity_unverified, readonly_unavailable, E_FORECAST_EXHAUSTION，与 v1 的映射在 contracts/spec/migration-map.json。forecast reason：no_samples, capacity_unknown, ledger_capacity_unknown, credits_conversion_missing, usd_samples_missing, reading_stale, window_unknown。risk 取 ok/low_reserve/critical/exhausted/unknown；risk_basis 取 tasks/usd/fraction/none；tasks_left_basis 取 tasks/usd/none。阈值表：tasks 依据 <=0 exhausted、1..2 critical、3..5 low_reserve、>=6 ok；fraction 依据 <=0 exhausted、<0.05 critical、<0.15 low_reserve、其余 ok；优先级 tasks > usd > fraction > unknown。可用性取 unverified/callable/blocked/unavailable/deprecated；identity 取 verified/unverified/mismatch。semantic_change：forecast.tasks_left、forecast.risk、handle.cli_removed、draft_reason_mapping、config_v1_to_v2。【6 额度池】{id:'claude:plan-5h', cli:'claude', kind:'plan_window', funding:'plan', window:{length_s:18000, anchor:'rolling', start_at:'...', reset_at:'...', reset_source:'cli|config|estimated|unknown'}, capacity_mtok:{'claude:claude-opus-5-5':{value:2, source:'config'}, 'claude:claude-sonnet-5-5':{value:10, source:'measured', confidence:'medium'}}, used_fraction:{value:0.5, source:'cli', at:'...'}, credits_per_mtok:null}。kind 取 plan_window/plan_weekly/credits/prepaid_usd；funding 取 plan/paid。v1 配置的 quotas 映射：remaining_pct 映射为计划内池，used=1-pct/100；remaining+credits 映射为 credits 池；remaining_usd 映射为 prepaid_usd 池；unit tokens 映射为容量已知的池。【7 forecast v1（只加字段）】{schema:'cliworker.forecast/v1', status:'known|unknown', model:'claude:claude-sonnet-5-5', remaining_mtok:5, remaining_fraction:0.5, pools:[{pool_id:'claude:plan-5h', remaining_mtok:5, remaining_fraction:0.5, reset_at:'...', reset_in_h:3, reset_source:'cli'}], tokens_per_task:{p25:0.05, p50:0.2, p90:0.9, n:12}, tasks_left:5, tasks_left_basis:'tasks', tasks_left_assumed:null, burn_mtok_per_hour:1.1, eta_exhaust_at:'...', exhausts_before_reset:false, risk:'ok', risk_basis:'tasks', confidence:'medium', reason:null, burn_per_task:0.42, samples:12}。公式：remaining(m)=min_p cap_p(m)*(1-clamp(used_p))；有新鲜读数（age<=reading_ttl_s，默认 600）时 used_p=reading+sum(读数之后的行) tokens_i/(cap_p(model_i)*1e6)，否则为窗口内同样求和；窗口内任一行模型容量未知时为 unknown(ledger_capacity_unknown)。计费 tokens=input+output+cache_write+cache_read_weight*cache_read，权重默认 0。分位数 nearest-rank：sorted[ceil(p*n)-1]，n>=3；Heavy/Normal/Light 取 p90/p50/p25。tasks_left=floor(remaining/分位数)。样本不足时 tasks_left 为 null，tasks_left_assumed=floor(remaining/policy.usage_estimate_mtok[usage])，confidence 为 none，risk 只能来自 fraction 或为 unknown。confidence：n=0 none，1..4 low，5..19 medium，>=20 high（变异系数>1 降为 medium）。burn=窗口内已用 Mtok/max(距窗口起点小时数,1/60)；eta=now+remaining/burn；输出保留 3 位小数，四舍五入远离零。容量学习：只用 Δfraction>=0.01 的读数对，cap=sum(tokens)/sum(Δfraction)/1e6，k<3 low，3..9 medium，>=10 high。所有 now 均取自 ctx.clock.now()。【8 选模策略】est 取分位数，样本不足时取 assumed；avail_p=remaining_p-有效预留-(importance 为 normal 时 reserve_fraction_for_high*cap_p)。A 类：计划内池全部已知且 min avail>=est，按紧迫度 min_p remaining_p/max(reset_in_h_p,0.25) 降序，再按价格升序、key 升序。B 类：计划内剩余未知且 unknown_policy 为 after_known，按 key 升序。C 类：付费池已知且 >=est，标 funding paid，按价格升序、key 升序。count>1 时先按 identity_group 去重贪心选，再按顺序补齐。【9 用量行 cliworker.usage/v1（只加字段）】{schema:'cliworker.usage/v1', id:'u_1', idempotency_key:'l_7d1e:post', lease_id:'l_7d1e', model:'claude:claude-sonnet-5-5', pools:['claude:plan-5h'], kind:'task|probe|manual', input_tokens:1200, output_tokens:300, cache_read_tokens:0, cache_write_tokens:0, cost_usd:0.0081, pool_fraction_before:0.48, pool_fraction_after:0.5, at:'...'}。同一 idempotency_key 写入返回已有 id，读取只计一次。【10 model/v1 与 inventory/v1】model：{schema:'cliworker.model/v1', key, id, cli, provider, vendor, aliases, allowed, level, level_source:{kind:'config|measured|cli', ref, at}, availability:{state, reason, at, ttl_s, evidence:{probe_id, cmd_redacted, exit, duration_ms, nonce_ok, reported_model, tokens}}, identity, capabilities:{context_tokens, readonly, stdin}, prices:{input_per_mtok, output_per_mtok, source}, source:{kind:'subcommand|help|cache|api|manual', ref, at}, deprecated}。inventory：{schema:'cliworker.inventory/v1', generated_at, host:{platform, arch, wsl_distros:[]}, entries:[{id, recognized, platform:'win32|darwin|linux|wsl:<d>', path, realpath, version, fingerprint:{size, mtime, realpath}, auth:{state:'logged_in|logged_out|token_ref|unknown', source:'cli_status'}, evidence:[{kind, cmd_redacted, exit, at, digest}], first_seen, last_seen, status:'present|gone'}]}。【11 配置 cliworker.config/v2 与路径】{schema:'cliworker.config/v2', state_dir:'./state', secrets:{kimi:{ref:'env:KIMI_API_KEY'}}, discovery:{extra_dirs:[], wsl:true, probe_unknown:false, unknown_patterns:['*-cli','*agent*'], cli_overrides:{}}, catalog:{allow:[], levels:{}, aliases:{}, deprecated:{}, manual:[]}, pools:[], policy:{probe_ttl_s:21600, lease_ttl_s:7200, reading_ttl_s:600, lock_stale_ms:30000, lock_wait_ms:5000, lock_poll_ms:50, session_ttl_s:43200, reserve_fraction_for_high:0.15, unknown_policy:'after_known|reject', usage_estimate_mtok:{Heavy:2, Normal:0.5, Light:0.1}, cache_read_weight:0, probe_schedule:null}}。resolvePaths({configPath, env})：configPath 依次取参数、CLIWORKER_CONFIG、CLIWORKER_HOME/config.json；state_dir 依次取显式值（相对路径按配置文件目录解析）、CLIWORKER_HOME/state/<sha256(规范化绝对路径，win32 转小写) 前 12 位>。CLI 与插件共用。无 schema 或 v1 配置在内存迁移并给 W_CONFIG_V1。带 _example:true，或忽略 _example 后与随包 example 深相等的配置返回 E_CONFIG_EXAMPLE。【12 HTTP 路由】AgentLine 级：POST /cliworker/select，只输出 AgentLine 视图；view:'full' 或 draft 无有效会话返回 403 E_VIEW_FORBIDDEN。自举例外：GET /cliworker/api/session 与 GET /cliworker/ui（静态外壳，无数据）不要求会话，只做 loopback 三项校验（socket 远端为 127.0.0.1/::1/::ffff:127.0.0.1；Host 主机名为 localhost/127.0.0.1/[::1]；Origin 缺省或为 loopback），失败返回 403 E_LOOPBACK_ONLY；session 响应 {schema:'cliworker.session/v1', session:'<32 字节随机 base64url>', csrf:'<base64url(HMAC-SHA256(进程密钥, session))>', expires_at:'...'}，只存内存，TTL 为 policy.session_ttl_s，进程重启失效，仅用请求头 x-cliworker-session 与 x-cliworker-csrf，不用 cookie。管理读：GET /cliworker/providers、/models、/forecast?model=<key>、/api/snapshot?since=<rev>、/api/jobs/<id>，无有效会话返回 403 E_ADMIN_REQUIRED。管理写：POST /cliworker/api/discover|enumerate|probe|read-usage（返回 job_id）、allow|deny|level|alias|manual-model|pool、secret（只写，响应仅 state:'set'）；判定顺序：无有效会话 E_ADMIN_REQUIRED，readonly E_READONLY，csrf 缺失或不匹配 E_CSRF，请求体非法 E_REQUEST_INVALID。公共：GET /cliworker/health 返回 {status:'ok|degraded', checks:[{id, ok, detail}], registration:'ok|failed', test_clock:false}，不含 provider 细节。所有 HTTP 响应与 CLI 输出共用 lib/contract/scan.mjs 检查。【13 CLI】init | paths | doctor | discover [--full] [--probe-unknown] | models enumerate|list|add|allow|deny|level|alias|probe|forecast|select | admin select | pools list|set | usage record|summary|import | cli resolve --model <key> --cwd <p> [--platform win32|darwin|linux|wsl:<d>] [--readonly] | run --lease <id> --state-dir <d> --config <c> | auth set <cli> [--from-env NAME]（不加时从 stdin 读）|status|clear | config migrate --in <v1> --out <v2> | state backup|restore|migrate | --version。除 run 输出 JSONL 外，stdout 都是单个 JSON，错误体 {ok:false, error:{code, message, retryable, retry_after}}，退出码按注册表；设置了 CLIWORKER_TEST_CLOCK_FILE 时每个输出 warnings 含 W_TEST_CLOCK。【14 宿主契约 contracts/host/dsh-host.v1.json】ctx.inject(['webServer'], fn(httpCtx))；httpCtx.effect(fn, name)；httpCtx.webServer.register({kind:'exact', path, handler(req,res)})；req 需提供 socket.remoteAddress 与 headers。createPlugin(hostCtx, settings, deps) 返回 {registered:[path], errors:[{path, message}]}；getRegistration() 返回 {status:'ok|failed', registered, errors}；strict:true 时注册失败直接抛出。【15 测试设施格式】AC 索引 contracts/spec/ac-index.json：{schema:'cliworker.ac-index/v1', acs:[{ac:'AC-038', owner:'T-029', milestone:'M5', levels:['smoke'], baseline:['real-smoke']}]}，baseline 只在此声明，取 linux/win32/darwin/real-smoke，unit/contract/integration/e2e 只能取前三者，smoke 只能取 linux 或 real-smoke。追踪分片 test/traceability/<T>.json：{task:'T-006', milestone:'M1', entries:[{ac:'AC-015', files:['test/unit/pools.test.mjs'], status:'covered'}]}，只能列属主为该任务的 AC；重复或非属主即失败；无分片的 AC 视为 planned。缺陷账本 test/characterization/defects.json：{defects:[{id:'a5-shell', owner_task:'T-010', owner_milestone:'M2', ac:'AC-026'}]}；缺陷文件含 [repro]（对 v0.1 副本）与 [fixed]（对 live lib）两部分。冻结清单 test/characterization/frozen-files.json：{source_commit:'f75bb76', files:[{path:'test/fixtures/characterization/v0.1/lib/select.mjs', sha256:'...'}]}，path 只能位于该副本目录或为 test/characterization/stable.test.mjs。运行清单 files-executed.json：{mode:'full|filtered', filter:null, files:[...], platform, node}，只有 full 做集合相等。跳过记录：{schema:'cliworker.skip/v1', test, file, ac:'AC-027', requires:'win32|wsl|darwin|linux|pwsh|secret-tool|security', platform, node, reason, at}。smoke 报告：{schema:'cliworker.smoke/v1', mode:'real|dry-run', version, platform, node, steps:[{id:'wsl-discover', ac:['AC-038'], mandatory:true, status:'pass|fail|skip', reason, duration_ms}], redacted:true}；dry-run 步骤为 discover, wsl-discover（夹具）, enumerate, probe, select, run, http-select；real 模式在 win32 主机上 wsl-discover 为 mandatory。豁免 release/waivers.json：{waivers:[{ac:'AC-038', reason:'...', approved_by:'...', version:'0.2.0'}]}，只适用于 baseline 为 real-smoke 的 AC，单列为 waived，不算 pass。全流程步骤 test/flows/steps/<id>.mjs 导出 {id, introduced_by, run(env)}，必需集合为 auth, doctor, discover, enumerate, probe, select, run, http-select, http-admin。【16 上下文与时钟 contracts/context/context.v1.json】createContext(overrides) 返回 {exec, fs, fetch, env, platform, stdout, stderr, random, clock, now}；clock：{now():number, nowIso():string, setTimeout(fn, ms):handle, clearTimeout(handle), sleep(ms):Promise}；now 等于 clock.now。真实实现在 lib/context.mjs，设置了 CLIWORKER_TEST_CLOCK_FILE 时 now() 每次读该文件（毫秒数或 ISO）。测试伪时钟 test/helpers/clock.mjs 另提供 setNow(t)、advance(ms):Promise（按到期时间、相同时按注册顺序触发，回调间让出微任务）、pending():number；伪时钟下 sleep 只随 advance 前进。test/helpers/ctx.mjs 提供 fakeExec（记录 argv、env 名、调用次数）、fakeFs（访问探针）、fakeClock、fakeFetch。【17 仓库内权威规格与金标对应】contracts/registry.snapshot.json 对应 AC-009、AC-010、AC-059 的码与触发、AC-067 的 semantic_change；contracts/spec/surfaces.json 对应 AC-005；contracts/spec/migration-map.json 对应 AC-034、AC-067；contracts/golden/quota-shapes.json 对应 AC-015；contracts/golden/b44.json 对应 AC-016；contracts/golden/forecast/*.json 对应 AC-017；contracts/golden/capacity.json 对应 AC-050；contracts/golden/policy/*.json 对应 AC-051；docs/contract.md 由 scripts/gen-contract-doc.mjs 生成。npm 包包含 contracts/registry.snapshot.json、contracts/schemas、contracts/host、contracts/context、contracts/agentline-forbidden.json，不含 contracts/golden、contracts/spec 与 .collab。\n","numLines":2,"startLine":1,"totalLines":2}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_018G4SEwTmhscAznJ7LHheJY","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
